  projectName: Quick Bio
  description: "Game Developer \xB7 Sound Designer \xB7 Unity \xB7 C#\nI'm Thomas,
    a game developer and sound designer based near Copenhagen. I build games that
    are well-crafted under the hood \u2014 clean C#, solid systems, and audio that
    actually does something.\nWith 5+ years across indie, academic, and professional
    projects, I've worn a lot of hats \u2014 programmer, designer, producer, project
    lead \u2014 often across cross-disciplinary and international teams. My background
    spans both a Bachelor's in Sound Design and a Master's in Game Design from ITU
    Copenhagen, which means I think about games from both a technical and experiential
    angle.\nCurrently open to studio roles. If something here catches your eye, I'd
    love to talk."
